    "title": "Notice: Restrictions on Non-Face-to-Face Online Courses for International Students",
    "category": "학사",
    "author": "생명공학대학 융합생명공학과",
    "department": "융합생명공학과",
    "date": "2026-07-28",
    "contentMarkdown": "In accordance with the International Education Quality Assurance System (IEQAS) to maintain university accreditation, starting from the 2026 academic year, credit completion through non-face-to-face online courses for international students will be restricted …",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "name": "붙임1. 외국인 유학생 비대면 온라인수업 이수 제한 안내문.pdf",
        "url": "https://biotech.skku.edu/gene/community/under_notice.do?mode=download&articleNo=222586&attachNo=198389"
      },
      {
        "name": "붙임2. 외국인 유학생 비대면 온라인수업 이수 제한 FAQ.pdf",
        "url": "https://biotech.skku.edu/gene/community/under_notice.do?mode=download&articleNo=222586&attachNo=198390"
      },
      {
        "name": "붙임3. (서식) 비대면 온라인수업 이수 제한 예외 신청 사유서.hwp",
        "url": "https://biotech.skku.edu/gene/community/under_notice.do?mode=download&articleNo=222586&attachNo=198391"
      }
    ],
    "sourceUrl": "https://biotech.skku.edu/gene/community/under_notice.do?mode=view&articleNo=222586&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10",
    "lastModified": null,
    "crawledAt": "2026-09-02T08:00:17.686Z",
    "editInfo": null,
    "schedule": null,
    "brief": {
      "language": "en",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "These courses can make up at most 30% of enrolled credits per semester."
        },
        {
          "text": "Fully pre-recorded and medium/large online courses count; blended courses like Flipped Learning or PBL do not."
        },
        {
          "text": "Excess courses may be cancelled for good, and next semester's scholarship may be lost."
        }
