      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "The talk covers Rashba interfacial coupling that ties magnetization to lattice motion."
        },
        {
          "text": "It covers nonreciprocal phonon propagation, then helicity-selective phonon-magnon angular momentum transfer."
        },
        {
          "text": "Interfaces without inversion symmetry are largely unexplored for spin-lattice coupling."
        }
